    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Mose atile, “Nga cakuti mwasanga umuntu nabamwipaya, alele mu mpanga, mu calo ico Yawe Lesa wenu alemupeela ukucipoka, nomba uwamwipaya teshibikwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intungulushi shenu na bakapingula bali nokuya pima ubutali ukufuma apabelele icitumbi ukuya fika na ku misumba iyili mupepi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi intungulushi sha mu musumba uupalamishe pa ncende pali icitumbi shikabuule umusepela wa ŋombe iyikota, uushatala aubombapo nangu ukufwala ikoli mu mukoshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaleutwala mwishika umushatala amulimwa nangu ukubyalwamo kabili ukuli umumana uulepisha amenshi. Mwishika mwine mulya emo bakafunine uyo umusepela wa ŋombe umukoshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashimapepo, abana baume bakwa Levi bakapalame, pantu Yawe Lesa wenu alibasala pakuti ebo balebomba no kulapaala amapaalo mwishina lyakwa Yawe no kupingula imilandu yonse palwa fikansa na palwa kucenana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo intungulushi shonse isha mu musumba uupalamishe pa ncende pali icitumbi, shili nokusamba iminwe pa mulu wa musepela wa ŋombe uyo bafunine umukoshi mwishika, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no kulasosa ashiti, ‘Te minwe yesu yasumishe uyu mulopa, kabili na menso yesu tayamwene uko calecitika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Belela uluse abantu bobe abena Israeli abo walubula, we Yawe, elyo witupeelelapo mulandu pa mfwa ya muntu wakaele.’ Kabili no mulopa ukafutila pa fyabubifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi efyo mukafumya pakati kenu umulandu wa kusumya konse ukwa mulopa wakaele, pantu namucita icalungama pa cinso cakwa Yawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ilyo mwaya kukulwisha abalwani benu, na Yawe Lesa wenu alenga ukuti mucimfye mu nkondo no kusenda bankole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga wamonapo nkole umo umwanakashi umusuma nganshi uo watemwa, kuti wamubuula ukuba umukashi obe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyo mwanakashi umusende kumobe, abeye ne mishishi, asembe ne ngala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elyo afuule ifyakufwala fya bunkole. Panuma yakwikala mu ŋanda umweshi utuntulu no kuloosha wishi na nyina, lyena kuti wamuupa waba umulume nao aba umukashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba nga takusekeshe, lyena muleke aye konse uko engatemwa ukuya. Tauli na kumushitisha, nangu ukumucita ngo musha, pantu wamupatikishafye pakulasendama nankwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nga cakuti umwaume umo ali na bakashi babili, atemwapo umo umbi iyoo, elyo bonse babili bamufyalila abana abaume. Elyo ibeli lyafyalwa mu mukashi ashatemwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo uyo muntu alefwaya ukwakanya ifyuma ku bana, tafwile nakuba na mucishacinani, tafwile kupeela ifyuma fye beli ku mwana uwa mukashi uo atemwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakupeela umwana wakwe uwe beli fyuma, alingile ukucishapo imiku ibili pali munyina. Nangu line tali mwana wa mu mukashi uo atemwisha. Pantu ibeli elyo ailangilepo amaka. Kanshi insambu ne cuma cine icabubeli, cakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
